  "_about": "The clinic's pipeline (docs/modes/clinic-design.md: the Mini-game quality pass Q1-Q7 over the Pipeline design P1-P13). One patient = waiting room -> diagnosis -> pharmacy (the belt) -> heal (a registered healing game, docs/clinic-heal-api.md) -> send-off. Read by js/clinic/pipeline.js in the browser and in Node (build/leak_clinic.mjs). Real Kutchi only where the family gave it (docs/kutchi-grammar-notes.md and the list at the top of the pipeline design): Muke {x} khape, ne, pela ... ne poi ..., the numbers, haa, nar (draft), wadho/nindho (he-forms), Salamun alaykum, Aabhar aanjo, Achija. Everything in [brackets] is an English placeholder, shown grey italic. Never invent Kutchi.",

